      "message": "The source of this is libvpx, though the storage is a bit different, so it might be a mistranslation here:\n\n\n```\n    const unsigned int bit_depth \u003d ctx-\u003eoxcf.input_bit_depth;\n```\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libvpx/+/03b2a50cc500b3365b0e21bbe325a658167dd9e5/vp9/vp9_cx_iface.c#461\n\nNote there\u0027s also [`g_input_bit_depth`](https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom/+/888312c00dbf80aecd962545dbd1390788be0d34/aom/aom_encoder.h#480) which says:\n\n```\n   * This value identifies the bit_depth of the input frames in bits.\n   * Note that the frames passed as input to the encoder must have\n   * this bit-depth.\n```\n\nSo it seems like that value should be used.",
